GIVETH A LIST OF `Definition of a term`
`the table of defined terms` MEANS
    LIST `Gov. Code § 12.2: spouse`
       , `Gov. Code § 15: oath`
       , `Gov. Code § 17: person`
       , `Gov. Code § 19: county`
       , `Gov. Code § 20: city`
       , `Gov. Code § 21: town`
       , `Civ. Code § 14(a): person`
       , `Civ. Code § 14(a): county`
       , `Civ. Code § 14(a): writing`
       , `Civ. Code § 14(a): oath`
       , `Civ. Code § 14(b)(1): property`
       , `Civ. Code § 14(b)(2): real property`
       , `Civ. Code § 14(b)(3): personal property`
